      "content": "The most efficient approach is to immediately issue a replacement vase, which is a gesture of goodwill that minimizes friction and secures the customer relationship. Simultaneously, you can process a small, goodwill credit on their account, which subtly acknowledges the inconvenience without admitting fault or incurring the full cost of a refund. This swift, proactive solution resolves the issue while maintaining a positive impression of our service.",
