    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The video thing sounds like it might just escalate the situation and make them angrier, especially if they're already demanding a refund. If we follow that path, we're likely looking at a long dispute or a bad review. Honestly, given the sensor data is so clean, if I were in your shoes, I'd probably just flag it as suspicious and deny it to protect our margins. Why are you still leaning towards giving them something, even if it's conditional?",
