      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the sensor data is compelling, ignoring the claim outright is a far greater long-term financial liability than a single replacement. The cost of a bad review or a public social media complaint far outweighs the cost of a single vase, especially when the customer is already emotionally invested in the transaction. Therefore, a swift, non-confrontational resolution is the best investment to protect our brand reputation.",
      "source": "target",
